    {
      "content": "Even with the correction that Jada makes twice as many dishes as Rory, each individual dish still requires **2 cups of clay**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Rory makes 20 more clay dishes than Kora.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "That change does not affect the amount of clay per dish. The problem still states that **each clay dish requires 2 cups of clay**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: Kora makes 20 clay dishes.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Kora makes 20 dishes, so Rory makes \\(20+20=40\\) dishes, and Jada makes \\(2\\times40=80\\) dishes. However, each individual dish still requires 2 cups of clay.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups per dish}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Great. Now let's take that a step further. How many total clay dishes do Jada and Rory make together?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Kora makes 20 dishes.\n\n- Rory makes \\(20+20=40\\) dishes.\n- Jada makes \\(2\\times40=80\\) dishes.\n- Together, Jada and Rory make:\n\n\\[\n80+40=\\boxed{120\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: Jada, Rory, and Kora make clay dishes for their school art project.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "That detail does not change the calculation:\n\n- Kora makes \\(20\\) dishes.\n- Rory makes \\(20+20=40\\) dishes.\n- Jada makes \\(2\\times40=80\\) dishes.\n\nThus, Jada and Rory make:\n\n\\[\n80+40=\\boxed{120\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Good, now using that, can you calculate: How many clay dishes do Jada, Rory, and Kora make together?",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "- Kora makes \\(20\\) dishes.\n- Rory makes \\(20+20=40\\) dishes.\n- Jada makes \\(2\\times40=80\\) dishes.\n\nTogether, they make:\n\n\\[\n80+40+20=\\boxed{140\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
